#: ../../book/open-models.rst:1
msgid ""
"Chapter 4: Public AI releases, private transfers, current Chinese "
"registration, proposed catalogue changes, and separate US publication rules."
msgstr ""
"अध्याय4: खुले AI, निजी हस्तांतरण, वर्तमान चीनी पंजीकरण, प्रस्तावित सूची और "
"अलग अमेरिकी प्रकाशन नियम।"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:5
msgid "04. Open Models: Public Releases and Private Transfers"
msgstr "04. खुले मॉडल: प्रकाशन और निजी हस्तांतरण"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:8
msgid "An Open License Is One Part of a Release"
msgstr "खुला लाइसेंस रिलीज का एक हिस्सा"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:11
msgid ""
"A team can publish code and weights for others to inspect, adapt and run. A "
"permissive copyright license is one part of that release. Applicable export,"
" data and safety rules still need assessment. DeepSeek-R1 and Qwen3 are "
"documented examples of public releases; their publication does not establish"
" an exemption for every related activity. `R1 <https://github.com/deepseek-"
"ai/DeepSeek-R1>`_ `QWEN <https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3>`_"
msgstr ""
"टीम कोड और भार प्रकाशित कर सकती है ताकि दूसरे उन्हें जांचें, बदलें और चलाएं।"
" उदार कॉपीराइट लाइसेंस इस प्रक्रिया का एक हिस्सा है। लागू निर्यात, डेटा और "
"सुरक्षा नियमों की भी जांच जरूरी है। DeepSeek-R1 और Qwen3 सार्वजनिक रिलीज के "
"उदाहरण हैं, सभी संबंधित गतिविधियों की छूट का प्रमाण नहीं। `R1 "
"<https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1>`_ `QWEN "
"<https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:15
msgid ""
"#import \"figures/artwork.typ\": release-gates\n"
"#release-gates()"
msgstr ""
"#import \"figures/artwork.typ\": release-gates\n"
"#release-gates()"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:15
msgid ""
"A release can follow different paths depending on the artifact, jurisdiction"
" and transfer. Existing public files and first releases need different "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"फाइल, कानून का क्षेत्र और हस्तांतरण तय करते हैं कि रास्ता क्या होगा। पहले से"
" खुली फाइल और पहली रिलीज अलग हैं।"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:21
msgid "Start with the Actual Artifact"
msgstr "असली फाइल से शुरू करें"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:24
msgid ""
"A public paper, downloadable weights, private training code and a later "
"fine-tune are different artifacts. The Open Source AI Definition asks for "
"freedoms and access to code, parameters and sufficient data information. A "
"product called open source may provide only some of these. A copyright label"
" alone also does not determine export-law status. `OSI "
"<https://opensource.org/ai/open-source-ai-definition>`_"
msgstr ""
"पत्र, डाउनलोड भार, निजी कोड और बाद का सुधार अलग चीजें हैं। खुले AI की "
"परिभाषा आजादी, कोड, पैरामीटर और पर्याप्त डेटा जानकारी मांगती है। कोई उत्पाद "
"केवल कुछ भाग दे सकता है। कॉपीराइट नाम निर्यात स्थिति नहीं तय करता। `OSI "
"<https://opensource.org/ai/open-source-ai-definition>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:26
msgid "China: Registration Now, Catalogue Proposal Separately"
msgstr "चीन: वर्तमान पंजीकरण और सूची प्रस्ताव अलग"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:29
msgid ""
"Announcement 48 requires temporary registration before covered transfers, "
"including unfinished exports. It identifies ownership transfers, overseas "
"licensing, foreign ownership or control changes and further notified cases. "
"The proposed catalogue prohibitions and licensing categories are a separate "
"track. A proposed prohibited entry is not, by itself, a new ban already in "
"force. Existing law still needs to be checked. `CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"घोषणा48 अधूरे सहित संबंधित हस्तांतरण से पहले पंजीकरण मांगती है। स्वामित्व, "
"विदेशी अनुमति, विदेशी नियंत्रण और अन्य सूचना शामिल हैं। सूची रोक·अनुमति अलग "
"चरण हैं। प्रस्ताव अपने आप लागू नया प्रतिबंध नहीं है; मौजूदा कानून भी देखें। "
"`CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:31
msgid ""
"We read the Chinese draft with its section-wide notes, rather than treating "
"every release as a compulsory sequence of four gates:"
msgstr ""
"हर रिलीज के चार अनिवार्य दरवाजे मानने की जगह पूरी श्रेणी के नोट के साथ मसौदा"
" पढ़ें:"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Already-public AI technology:** Note 1 excludes technology already public "
"through open source or papers. Identify exactly what was published. A paper "
"about private weights does not publish those weights; a private derivative "
"does not automatically inherit every exclusion. `CN-A1, note 1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
" **पहले से सार्वजनिक AI:**  नोट1 खुले या पत्र से प्रकाशित तकनीक को बाहर करता"
" है। असल में क्या प्रकाशित है, देखें। पत्र निजी भार नहीं खोलता; निजी बदलाव "
"को हर छूट अपने आप नहीं मिलती। `CN-A1, note 1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Unpublished data-sensitive technology:** The draft places specified core-"
"data models in a proposed prohibited category and important-data models in a"
" restricted category. The trace-data exclusion has several conditions, not "
"just a 0.1% test. These categories need exact facts and legal "
"interpretation. `CN-A1, 266501J and 266504X "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
" **अप्रकाशित संवेदनशील डेटा तकनीक:**  खास मुख्य डेटा मॉडल प्रतिबंध और "
"महत्वपूर्ण डेटा मॉडल सीमा प्रस्ताव में हैं। मामूली उपयोग की छूट में0.1% से "
"ज्यादा शर्तें हैं। सही तथ्य·व्याख्या चाहिए। `CN-A1, 266501J and 266504X "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Other unpublished controlled technology:** Check alternative model "
"thresholds and any agent, chip-design or cluster technology being "
"transferred. Being below one model threshold does not clear every entry, "
"existing law or bundled artifact. `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
" **अन्य निजी तकनीक:**  वैकल्पिक मॉडल सीमा और साथ जाने वाला एजेंट·चिप·समूह "
"देखें। एक सीमा से नीचे होना दूसरे बिंदु, कानून या फाइल की मंजूरी नहीं। "
"`CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Facilitated routes:** Note 2 proposes automatic licensing or similar "
"facilitation for specified restricted AI exports, including open-source "
"releases, overseas chip fabrication and certain self-operated computing "
"centers. An exclusion and an easier permission route are different. Final "
"procedures and applicable conditions still matter. `CN-A1, note 2 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
msgstr ""
" **सरल रास्ते:**  नोट2 खास खुले AI, विदेशी निर्माण और अपने कंप्यूटर केंद्र "
"को स्वत: अनुमति जैसी सुविधा देता है। छूट और आसान मंजूरी अलग हैं; अंतिम "
"प्रक्रिया और शर्तें देखें। `CN-A1, note 2 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:39
msgid ""
"#import \"figures/diagrams.typ\": release-reading-map\n"
"#release-reading-map(lang: \"en\")"
msgstr ""
"#import \"figures/diagrams.typ\": release-reading-map\n"
"#release-reading-map(lang: \"hi\")"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:39
msgid ""
"Keep three questions separate: what is already operating, what the Chinese "
"draft proposes, and what the US rules cover. These are reading questions, "
"not a transaction clearance."
msgstr ""
"वर्तमान पंजीकरण, चीन का प्रस्ताव और अमेरिकी नियम तीन अलग सवाल हैं। यह समझने "
"का तरीका है, सौदे की मंजूरी नहीं।"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:45
msgid "United States: A Separate Jurisdiction Test"
msgstr "अमेरिका: अलग अधिकार क्षेत्र जांच"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:48
msgid ""
"First establish whether the artifact is subject to the EAR. Published-"
"information provisions and the 4E091 notes can exclude qualifying public "
"technology or weights. The model-weight entry has additional-training "
"conditions for derivatives, so a privately improved model is not "
"automatically treated like its public base. The announced non-enforcement "
"policy and GAO's decision must also be distinguished from the published "
"text. `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR774, 4E091 "
"notes <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_ `GAO26 "
"<https://www.gao.gov/products/b-337935>`_"
msgstr ""
"पहले देखें फाइल EAR में है या नहीं। प्रकाशन·4E091 योग्य सार्वजनिक सामग्री को"
" बाहर कर सकते हैं। बदले मॉडल पर अतिरिक्त प्रशिक्षण शर्तें हैं; निजी सुधार "
"मूल के बराबर नहीं। गैर-अमल नीति, GAO और लिखित नियम भी अलग हैं। `EAR734 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR774, 4E091 notes "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_ `GAO26 "
"<https://www.gao.gov/products/b-337935>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:50
msgid ""
"MOFCOM's answer on API, app, web, SaaS and lightweight local deployment "
"concerns restricted large models under the proposed measures. It should not "
"be turned into a universal US exemption or a clearance for other Chinese "
"controls. Handing private weights to another party is also different from "
"providing a remote service. `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"API·ऐप·वेब·SaaS·हल्की तैनाती पर चीनी उत्तर प्रस्ताव के सीमित बड़े मॉडल के "
"बारे में है। इसे अमेरिकी सामान्य छूट या दूसरे चीनी नियंत्रण की मंजूरी नहीं "
"बनाते। निजी भार देना दूरस्थ सेवा से अलग है। `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:52
msgid "Possible Effects on Open Models"
msgstr "खुले मॉडलों पर संभावित असर"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Continued public releases** are consistent with the draft's explicit "
"facilitation. **More documentation or delay** is a possible result of "
"classification work. **A public smaller model alongside a private service** "
"is a possible business choice. **Greater concentration of training** is a "
"possible result if affordable computing becomes harder to obtain. These are "
"mechanisms to investigate, not outcomes established by the announcement or "
"measured forecasts. `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" `NTIA <https://www.ntia.gov/sites/default/files/publications/ntia-ai-open-"
"model-report.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
" **खुली रिलीज जारी रहना**  सुविधा नीति के अनुरूप है।  **अधिक रिकॉर्ड या "
"देरी** ,  **खुला छोटा मॉडल और निजी सेवा** ,  **प्रशिक्षण का केंद्रीकरण**  "
"संभव रास्ते हैं। ये जांचने वाले तर्क हैं, सिद्ध परिणाम या मापे अनुमान नहीं। "
"`CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" `NTIA <https://www.ntia.gov/sites/default/files/publications/ntia-ai-open-"
"model-report.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:57
msgid ""
"We should not claim that chip restrictions caused a particular model's "
"efficiency improvements without evidence isolating that cause. Smaller "
"parameter counts do not guarantee exclusion because other criteria may "
"apply. Local use can reduce reliance on a remote service, but it does not by"
" itself guarantee privacy, security or clinical reliability."
msgstr ""
"अलग कारण साबित किए बिना किसी दक्षता सुधार को चिप रोक का परिणाम नहीं कहते। कम"
" पैरामीटर छूट की गारंटी नहीं। स्थानीय उपयोग दूरस्थ निर्भरता घटा सकता है, "
"गोपनीयता·सुरक्षा·चिकित्सकीय भरोसा गारंटी नहीं।"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:59
msgid "A Practical Release Record"
msgstr "उपयोगी रिलीज रिकॉर्ड"

#: ../../book/open-models.rst:62
msgid ""
"Our suggested record identifies the model version, file hashes, license, "
"public and private artifacts, data categories, measured criteria, recipient,"
" destination and transfer form. Keep publication evidence and any relevant "
"filing or permission. This is a documentation suggestion, not a new "
"compulsory form or a substitute for the official registration fields. `CN-A2"
" "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-2.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"संस्करण, फाइल हैश, लाइसेंस, खुले·निजी भाग, डेटा, माप, पाने वाला, देश, तरीका "
"और प्रकाशन·अनुमति प्रमाण सहेजना सुझाव है। यह नया अनिवार्य फॉर्म या सरकारी "
"फॉर्म का विकल्प नहीं। `CN-A2 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-2.pdf>`_"
